        "id": 2016000
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-12-20T20:36:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What I am ideally looking for is very similar to this function without the final AES-KWP unwrap. If you fully controlled the protocol, it would be possible to use `secure_key_import`, but it seems kludgy to generate, wrap, and transmit another key when just a key exchange would do.",
      "parentUuid": "7180b742_106b73f0",
      "revId": "5489e4042a48b9dee25a76018231fcf4f27dbb12",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
